<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 02:33:09 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>圣克鲁兹Jack's Burgers探店</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee8de110a74</link><description>&lt;p&gt;探索圣克鲁兹。

📍 杰克汉堡店，加利福尼亚州圣克鲁兹&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A restaurant pick up window with the chef framed in the opening " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jmj/6aee8de110a74.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jmj.some.pics"&gt;@jmj&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 02:33:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巫术中的感恩练习</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee74d93bfb9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在你的巫术实践中，也有感恩的空间。你可以点燃一支蜡烛，说出别人对你的善举。花时间回想他们所做的，能帮你找到感谢他们的话语。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-and-rose storybook scene of a witch writing a note at a candlelit wooden desk beside a sleeping cat. Ivy and pink curtains frame a round window showing an airborne postal boat carrying envelopes above a moonlit hillside village. Warm ivory lettering fills the upper wall, and a gold emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: There's room for gratitude in your witchcraft. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6aee74d93bfb9.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 00:46:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《亡者之舞》后读《夜之盛宴》</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee40960e354</link><description>&lt;p&gt;读完了《什么让死者移动》，所以自然而然地我开始读《什么在夜晚进食》了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='Photo of the book "What Feasts At Night", by T. Kingfisher' height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/swrogers/6aee40960e354.jpg" width="4000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://swrogers.some.pics"&gt;@swrogers&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 21:03:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>2024年11月</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee3d81678a2</link><description>&lt;p&gt;2024年11月&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Snail" height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maria/6aee3d81678a2.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maria.some.pics"&gt;@maria&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 20:50:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Kiss the Sky Books 建筑招牌</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee211c6f3e5</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;主街上建筑物上的Kiss the Sky Books图形照片，旁边有一根电线杆和电线——所有这些都以蓝天为背景。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Photo of Kiss the Sky Books graphic on a building on Main Street, with a phone pole and wires - all against a blue sky. " height="4000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dfir/6aee211c6f3e5.jpg" width="6000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dfir.some.pics"&gt;@dfir&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 18:49:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>意大利雨巷红伞行人</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee1eeb9b1d1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;意大利灰色石砌建筑之间，一条斜向铺就的湿漉漉的瓷砖街道。可见几位行人，其中一人撑着红伞。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A wet street of diagonally arranged tiles between gray stone buildings in Italy. A few pedestrians are seen, one with a red umbrella. " height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dfir/6aee1eeb9b1d1.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dfir.some.pics"&gt;@dfir&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 18:39:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>宾大博物馆费城探索</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee19ae3053d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;探索费城的宾夕法尼亚大学博物馆。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Egyptian artifacts w/ hieroglyphs. The sign said they were sketches which is wild that this wasn’t someone’s final version!" height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/azaleah/6aee19ae3053d.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://azaleah.some.pics"&gt;@azaleah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 18:17:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Droam</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee08c34eccb</link><description>&lt;p&gt;德罗姆&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Droam" height="873" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6aee08c34eccb.jpg" width="1320"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 17:05:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Droam</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee06f2a61a9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;德罗姆&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Droam" height="862" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6aee06f2a61a9.jpg" width="1320"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:57:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Droam</title><link>https://some.pics/6aee06d844c2c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;德罗姆&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Droam" height="862" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6aee06d844c2c.jpg" width="1320"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:57:04 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>